        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1a41c7e1-a655-4c63-b4db-c22bdff18003\",\"review_text\":\"Worst application 👎👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"dceb14e7-2df0-422f-bb2b-73d7c373159a\",\"review_text\":\"I gave one star because I can't give any less than that. the new update is sooooooo annoying like I can't even play the songs that I like and I can't rewind songs what the heck\"},{\"review_id\":\"5fba12ea-4980-4f25-a129-f830a3974fd2\",\"review_text\":\"I find Spotify very good, it finds and play whatever music you want and also adds songs that you might like, judging from your playlist if you choose to arrange one. 😊💃🎸🎶\"},{\"review_id\":\"ac4e860a-c042-49cc-90f3-189591c336ac\",\"review_text\":\"paying for subscribing but unable to play in offline mode really?\"},{\"review_id\":\"9034d675-9582-49b6-a1c1-c4ddabf8baf1\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever too much ad\"},{\"review_id\":\"d2f3874f-d15d-4a2f-bb97-4f1213defa46\",\"review_text\":\"Too expensive and the free version is pretty much unusable with constant ads... Every two or three songs.. Forget it\"},{\"review_id\":\"99b93e31-9f15-4daa-88ac-349ab0419c48\",\"review_text\":\"This update very bad for everyone.old Spotify. we all want.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca63dfbe-7120-4e18-af6e-8ea786cd157d\",\"review_text\":\"I'm loving the experience with the app\"},{\"review_id\":\"083811c7-d469-499b-9bef-5b9fb096653d\",\"review_text\":\"best app ever\"}]}"
